---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Personal Cybersecurity 101">
  <h1>Personal Cybersecurity 101</h1>
    <ul>
      <li>Remove Flash</li>
      <li>Remove Java</li>
      <li>Set plugins as <a href="http://www.howtogeek.com/188059/how-to-enable-click-to-play-plugins-in-every-web-browser/" target="_blank">&#39;click-to-play&#39;</a> in your browsers</li>
      <li>Use different password for each website <em>(see below)</em></li>
      <li>Use a password manager (so you can realistically do ^^). Or even write them down and store safely.</li>
      <li>Use two-factor authentication (2FA) wherever available</li>
      <li>Use the following browser extensions:
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/gorhill/uBlock" target="_blank">uBlock Origin</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.eff.org/HTTPS-EVERYWHERE" target="_blank">HTTPS Everywhere</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.eff.org/privacybadger" target="_blank">Privacy Badger</a></li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>Use &#39;private mode&#39; in your browser when appropriate</li>
      <li>Keep your stuff up to date - programs and operating system</li>
      <li>Use common sense</li>
    </ul>
</PageLayout>
